# LF everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# This is not a style preference. `src/vectors.v1.json` is embedded with include_str! and pinned
# by SHA-256, and the digest is of the LF bytes. Left to Git's default on Windows the file
# checks out with CRLF, the digest test fails, and the failure appears only on Windows — so CI's
# Linux jobs stay green while a contributor on Windows is told the fixture has been tampered
# with.
* text=auto eol=lf
